  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Meeting the objectives of the UNICEF&#x2019;s Humanitarian Action for Children Appeal for Syrian Arab Republic 2021 with a funding requirement amounting to 330.8 million USD.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This allocation contributes to meeting the objectives of UNICEF&#x2019;s Humanitarian Action for Children Appeal for the Syrian Arab Republic 2021. UNICEF&#x2019;s efforts in Syria is concentrated on protection, health, nutrition, water, sanitation and hygiene. This includes UNICEF&#x2019;s engagement in North-East Syria and the camps al-Hol and al-Roj. https://www.unicef.org/reports</narrative>
  </description>
